an move to g5 or f6 to escort the pawn. Moving the pawn immediately is the most forcing and simplest path. Moving the king first (e.g., Kf6) also works, but the pawn move doesn’t waste time. The bishop is not needed for promotion; it can be moved later to avoid stalemate tricks. So **P: g5-g6** is the clearest winning move.\n\nAnswer: P: g5-g6'}
